1
00:00:06,042 --> 00:00:09,292
This blade has a dark past.

2
00:00:10,592 --> 00:00:14,592
It has shed much innocent blood.

3
00:00:16,792 --> 00:00:20,242
You're a fool for traveling alone,
so completely unprepared.

4
00:00:20,542 --> 00:00:23,592
You're lucky your blood's still flowing.

5
00:00:24,042 --> 00:00:25,092
Thank you.

6
00:00:26,292 --> 00:00:27,792
So...

7
00:00:28,192 --> 00:00:32,592
What brings you to
the land of the gatekeepers?

8
00:00:33,792 --> 00:00:36,292
I'm searching for someone.

9
00:00:36,792 --> 00:00:40,992
Someone very dear?
A kindred spirit?

10
00:00:42,192 --> 00:00:43,792
A dragon.

11
00:00:47,642 --> 00:00:50,542
A dangerous quest for a lone hunter.

12
00:00:51,742 --> 00:00:54,662
I've been alone for
as long as I can remember.

